.TH HOME-AUDIT 1 "2026-10-13" "SASD Freeware" "Unix Administration"
.SH NAME
home-audit \- Check local passwd home-directory metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhome-audit\fR [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks only the home-directory inode and never follows a home symbolic link. Findings do not by themselves imply compromise. NSS-only users are outside the local-file scope.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file PATH
Read the specified passwd-style file.
.TP
.B --min-uid N, --max-uid N
Default range is UID 1000 through 59999.
.TP
.B --all
Include every valid local passwd record.
.TP
.B --null
Emit NUL-separated ISSUE, USER, UID, HOME records.
.TP
.B --help
Display usage information.
.TP
.B --version
Display program version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 completed, 1 malformed local data or traversal errors, 2 argument errors, 3 missing prerequisites.
.SH SEE ALSO
passwd(5), group(5), getent(1)
.SH AUTHOR
SASD Freeware contributors.
